Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...live...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chan, you're so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to have recovered after all.\NBy his willpower alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna swim like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin, you can swim with a bubble on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any craftsman in the city\Ncan make one for you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad because if he has a nosebleed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't have blood for a transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sanji's blood type is very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's not good, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Camie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There is somebody that I really\Nwanna see on the Fish-Man Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? The Mermaid Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jimbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Jimbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy, you mean Jimbei the Warlord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he resigned during the war so he's the former Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you?\NYou know the pirate empress, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When Ace died 2 years ago, I didn't lose heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...thanks to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Jimbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at the Fish-Man Island in 2 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the day\Nwhen you and your friends visit us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a promise to meet\Nagain on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I read in the newspaper\Nthat you were with Jimbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Jimbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Boss is not on the island now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He resigned from the Warlords\Nduring the war 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So the former members of the Fish-Man\NPirates could no longer stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and they left with Boss Jimbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! So I can't see him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story. But the war had a\Nlot of effects on this island too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,--Camie!\N--Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,--Camie!\N--Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--A ship is coming!\N--It might be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,--The royal family's ship!\N--Maybe no one's on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure somebody is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's on it, Medaka-chin sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,--You don't often see the royal family's ship.\N--They seldom come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're coming to catch Luffy-chin\Nand the others for illegal entry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys need to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chan, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,RYUGU PALACE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the royal family's gondola?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,--It is!\N--Maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:05:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--I bet so!\N--So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But it can't be somebody\Nfrom the royal family!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't bother coming all the\Nway to this corner of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Neptune 3 brothers-sama are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.87,0:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, girls of the cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}RYUGU KINGDOM THE NEPTUNE 3 BROTHERS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--Princes!\N--What brought you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Princes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide here and stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I received a report of an illegal entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}FIRST SON - FUKABOSHI (SHARK MERMAN)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't they come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've seen them, tell me-fa-so-la-ti-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}SECOND SON - RYUBOSHI (OARFISH MERMAN)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you haven't seen them, that's fine-mi-re-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonfish! Shake, shake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}THIRD SON - MANBOSHI (MOONFISH MERMAN)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna stay here and play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That you princes have\Nto come all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure if they're\Nwho I think they are yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not sure-mi-re-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, let's dance together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! They're the\Nprinces of Neptune's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmmm. Okay. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll check somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you when you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance another time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the bother-so-fa-mi-re-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the border guards\Nwere just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too much blood! He's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't hold it! All that\Npent-up excitement exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistaking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate - Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ammo Knights!\N--Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! Straw Hat and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do? They'll catch them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't wanna cause any\Ntrouble with Neptune's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry about the illegal entry!\NBut you can't arrest us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can somebody donate blood now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done,\Nour friend is gonna die within an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His blood type is S RH negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare but does anybody here share the same blood type?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are Fish-Men and Mermaids'\Nblood totally different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time! Anyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... This is the dumbest way to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody please! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give blood to Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin, Chopper-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids and Fish-Men blood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,are the same as humans so we can donate blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those humans are talking nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys with sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Fukaboshi, that's Hammond\Nfrom the Fish-Man District.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nobody on this island who would
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,\Ngive blood to such lowly creatures as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If somebody does,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he risks the Punishment of the Dark Night from human haters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He can just keep losing\Nblood helplessly and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There is this old law in our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Donating blood to humans is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:10:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake!\NYou humans set the rule first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You people have a long history\Nof fearing us as monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and refused to get your blood mixed-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Fisher Tiger,\Nthe hero of the Fish-Man Island, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He risked his own life to\Nfree slaves of all races
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but after a bloody war,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he lost his life although he could've\Nsurvived if he had a transfusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those heartless humans\Nrefused to give blood so he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, here is what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up on your crewmember's life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nand come to the Fish-Man District with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain of the New Fish-Man Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hordy Jones is expecting you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't know about the law but please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:11:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone with S RH negative?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to repay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as long as you save his life now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I said "It's no use"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I said "It's no use"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't comply...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...I'll take you by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Trawl Net!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that we weren't gonna join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, a monster behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammond and the others got...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster gave up without fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it? Luffy-chan's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin and everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Sanji-chin, too! Let's go to the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ryugu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many humans at the\Nharbor of the town! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're ready! Camie, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Please, Ryugu-chin,\Ntake us to the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, wait! The Ryugu is Princes'...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'll bring it back to\Nyou as soon as we save Sanji-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a ride home-fa-mi-re-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. If my blood type\Nmatched, I wouldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It all started because of his lecherous feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. He's still smiling a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...And at the same time, it's nice and bouncy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, that's enough!\NDon't think about anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in a delicate state!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Hachi were discriminated\Nagainst at Sabaody 2 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so I guess it really runs deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji's dirty\Nmind caused such a big issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and even if we get to the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,\NI don't know if we can find a donor right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't had that many\Nhuman visitors for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are our first visitors in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? I thought this was the famous scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is a famous spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They say maybe somebody\Nis standing in the voyagers' way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:14:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody powerful is up to something\N- that's the talk of the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was no good, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you hiding the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Prince Fukaboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They were Camie's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And they were good people and we\Ndidn't want them to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Sanji-chan will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You ladies mistook us.\NHe's a well-known pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he didn't need to go through immigration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we know his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We were looking for them for\Nanother reason-re-mi-fa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were unable to deliver\Nthe message from Jimbei, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a town at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji-chin, you lost almost\Nall the blood from your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that we found the blood donor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.19,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:16:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get up so fast! You need to rest more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But why won't the Fish-Men donate blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We looked everywhere in the\Ntown but we couldn't find a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, thank you for doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was I and what was I doing?\NI can barely remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't think back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want you to have a nosebleed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Sanji! Let me introduce you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to the blood donor that\Nwe finally found at a bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to say "thank you"!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't tell me that I got\Nblood from such a delicate lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.53,0:17:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that he's back to his old self!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, say "thank you" to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let me see your right arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Positive reaction for poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a poisonous wound as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, when I\Nfought against the Fish-Men...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt something sting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be deadly poison.\NAre you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An antibody must have developed\Nin your body to counter such poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been poisoned before?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost died from\Npoisoning in the Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost died? It's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.19,0:18:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,\NThe swordsman with octopus tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He blocked my punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he's very strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's coming from the cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Mermaids are really noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are all messed-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I accidentally poisoned Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be in trouble if he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.97,0:18:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishilly and the others were screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishilly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishilly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard them around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard them talking about opening a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come here.\NThere's somebody I'd like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The owner of the Mermaid\NCafe who let Sanji stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...Madam Sharley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the blond boy okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}THE OWNER OF THE MERMAID CAFE MADAM SHARLEY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. But since you're\Nsuch a beautiful lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it's best you stay away from the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's not tell Sanji-chin\Nthat this place is in the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,back of the Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,His doctor, Chopper-chin said that if\Nhe finds out, there'll be trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange prognosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Madam Sharley, Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--What's this?\N--It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, Straw Hat boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the crystal ball she\Nuses to look into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam's pre-vision is\Nfamous in the Coral Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not practicing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better not knowing the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about this? Do you Mermaids poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that have to\Ndo with her pre-vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any class?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Apologize to her, Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie, you can take a day off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them around the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You always work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...these days we don't\Nhave human pirate guests
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and my business is drying up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls from the cove will come soon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.93,0:20:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have enough hands (hitode).
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:21:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough starfish (hitode)...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I should have delivered\Nthose clams to Pappagu by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so out-of-context!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Monsieur Pappagu is having\Nfun at the cafe with his old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At the cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't mention this in front of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nbut when Madam was a little child,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,she said that many pirates\Nwould come to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the year before\Nthe Great Pirate Era began.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.14,0:21:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Among a host of other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nshe recently predicted the war at Marineford
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and Whitebeard's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't stand knowing\Nwhat bad things will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.07,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's taking care of Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,--Luffy-chin! Usopp-chin!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the main street of Coral Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! That's the entrance\Nof the Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.23,0:22:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm getting hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.39,0:22:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have food too! Cakes and sea fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What about meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We Merfolk don't eat meat and fish
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so what we have is; Wakame Brûlée,\NMozuku Tart, Kelp Soufflé...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they edible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, we have meat too!\N--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shellfish meat! Scallop\NSandwich, Freshwater Clam Pizza...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not meat!\NDon't ruin meat's reputation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa... Anyway, let's\Ngo in! The Mermaid Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Pappagu will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't ruin meat's reputation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.72,0:23:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Resting my bones! Resting my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,--Brook!\N--Brook-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy-san and Usopp-san!\NAnd it's been a while, Camie-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw! Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you guys!\NI didn't know that you were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.89,0:23:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were with Pappagu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I didn't expect to be\Nrescued by Pappagu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, beautiful Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going boneless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't exist without bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.07,0:23:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't care if I die now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.66,0:23:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.29,0:23:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He got so hyper in the cafe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wonder what's going on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:24:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't leaving today, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are interested in the cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.13,0:24:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can come back with everybody later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna take Bone to my house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me! Do you like sea monster meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.02,0:24:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have meat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wild, I don't wanna eat\Nseaweed or shellfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mainly eat is violent sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.07,0:24:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pappagu, I almost forget!\NHere are your clams for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Camie's best clams!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.67,0:24:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you eat shellfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.21,0:24:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike Merfolk, Fish-Men eat meat and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we don't have them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.60,0:24:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, glad to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just what I was looking for! Hey, taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.61,0:24:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:25:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken! He's a ghost -\NWhy are they looking for him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this guy was on the\Nghost ship that we saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.50,0:25:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?! Did you guys see him?\N--Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole nation has been\Nlooking for him for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.41,0:25:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate--an undersea bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.51,0:25:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about it later. Get on first!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.59,0:25:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken was sending love letters...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.68,0:25:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...to the Mermaid Princess of the\NRyugu Kingdom at least once a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, the letters became\Npackages, then threats to marry him...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.69,0:25:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fluffy! Feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's like heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.49,0:25:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to a starfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.61,0:25:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay!\N--Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.83,0:25:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His eccentric behavior made\Nthe Mermaid Princess afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and it became a national concern...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Mermaid Princess'\Nfather - King Neptune got mad
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.51,0:26:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and those 3 princes that we just met
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nhave been looking for him with the army
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.68,0:26:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but they can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.64,0:26:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie, Camie... I was just\Ntelling them about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.52,0:26:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, the God of the Sea,\Nwho runs this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...has 4 children including\Nthe Mermaid Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.94,0:26:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mermaid Princess is the youngest\Nand the 3 princes are older than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.91,0:26:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Camie...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I can't understand is
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.24,0:26:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Deck must be a ghostly\Npirate from hundreds of years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.96,0:26:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, those legends are often exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He truly existed and in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.25,0:26:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the legendary\Ncaptain--Vander Decken...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.94,0:26:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...reached the Fish-Man Island and died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.06,0:27:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship that you saw was the\NFlying Dutchman, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.57,0:27:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his descendent who is on the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken IX!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.70,0:27:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! His descendent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.58,0:27:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.65,0:27:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that it was a real ghost and felt
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nmore dead than alive since I'm a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.39,0:27:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good. That's just good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie... Camie... Camie...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When I look closer,\NMerfolk and Fish-Men are all different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.39,0:27:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There are old Mermaids! Like Grandma Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.36,0:27:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The father is a Fish-Man and the\Nchildren are Merfolk and Fish-Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.77,0:27:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When a Mermaid and a Fish-Man get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.74,0:27:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,their kids would be either Merfolk\Nor Fish-Man, either boy or girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are 4 possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.70,0:27:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmmm, that's why they're all different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.44,0:27:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.17,0:28:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get on the highway!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a candy factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.18,0:28:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, why is there a pirate flag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That? You can see the same flag at the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nentrance of the island and at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That flag is protecting\Nthe Fish-Man Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.28,0:28:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The mark belongs to a pirate called\NCharlotte Linlin of the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.03,0:28:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Also known as Big Mam,\None of The Four Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-The Four Emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.70,0:28:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the war, Whitebeard was\Nprotecting the island from pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.88,0:28:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but now it's Big Mam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.13,0:28:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.01,0:28:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But she demands a lot of sweet\Ncandies every month in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the factory is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Candies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.61,0:28:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This country can't exist without the\Nprotection of those powerful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.69,0:29:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how dangerous this place is,\Nwhere pirates come and go frequently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's protecting the country\Nafter old man Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.79,0:29:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Big Mam a good person?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.07,0:29:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.31,0:29:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard never demanded anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.70,0:29:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So Big Mam views it as business, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.25,0:29:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mam...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One of The Four Emperors like Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if I'll meet her someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.50,0:29:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in Fishverly Hills,\Nthe town of the celebs!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.59,0:29:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That tall building right in\Nfront of us is Pappagu's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.64,0:29:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That?! That's too much for a starfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.94,0:29:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.58,0:29:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a madam from the Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.65,0:29:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Madam Sharley?\NWhy are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.08,0:29:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.40,0:30:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Madam! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.75,0:30:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate boy with a straw hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.35,0:30:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And throw him out of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a pre-vision again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't planning on using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,\NBut I felt something about him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.77,0:30:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't help looking into the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.38,0:30:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! What did you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.44,0:30:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharley! Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.35,0:30:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,--Madam!\N--Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.37,0:30:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it won't happen!\NI hope it'll be proven wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That barrel drifted here along\Nwith Camie's friends. What's in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Liquor? Treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. It's very tightly-sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Should\Nwe open it secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're well-prepared, Ishilly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,--Brook!\N--Brook-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a Mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw! Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul King, come to see us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a wonderful time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, beautiful Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike Merfolk, Fish-Men eat meat and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we don't have them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.37,0:30:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it won't happen!\NI hope it'll be proven wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.13,0:30:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A human with a straw hat on...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,At Straw Hat Luffy's\Nhands...  at his hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the Fish-Man Island will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.73,0:31:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...destroyed!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...We can give you more, silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul King, come to see us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}THE RYUGU KINGDOM CORAL HILL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}MADAM SHARLEY'S HOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay! We're both humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help each other\Nwhen we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay! We're both humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help each other\Nwhen we're in trouble.
